        "text_eA8q3Y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We really love the gear we’ve put together here. It’s the kind of stuff we actually use when we head out ourselves.</p><p>If you’re starting your morning at camp, you’ll probably be reaching for the <a href=\"/collections/aeropress\" title=\"AeroPress\"><strong>AeroPress</strong></a>, <a href=\"/collections/bialetti\" title=\"Bialetti\"><strong>Bialetti</strong></a>, or <a href=\"/collections/timemore\" title=\"Timemore\"><strong>Timemore</strong></a>. Maybe a quick <a href=\"/collections/southland-coffee\" title=\"Southland Coffee\"><strong>Southland Coffee</strong></a> pour-over while you're heating water on a <a href=\"/collections/trangia\" title=\"Trangia\"><strong>Trangia</strong> </a>or stove. For meals, we’ve got <a href=\"/collections/back-country-cuisine\" title=\"Back Country Cuisine\"><strong>Back Country Cuisine</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/hungry-hiker\" title=\"Hungry Hiker\"><strong>Hungry Hiker</strong></a>—really good fuel for when you’re miles from anywhere. You can even bake a proper dinner in an <a href=\"/collections/omnia\" title=\"Omnia\"><strong>Omnia</strong></a> oven or use <a href=\"/collections/gsi-outdoors\" title=\"GSI Outdoors\"><strong>GSI Outdoors</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/wacaco\" title=\"Wacaco\"><strong>Wacaco</strong></a> for those little comforts that make a trip.</p><p>When it’s time to set up for the night, we trust <a href=\"/collections/kelty\" title=\"Kelty\"><strong>Kelty</strong></a>, <a href=\"/collections/nemo\" title=\"Nemo\"><strong>NEMO</strong></a>, and <a href=\"/collections/onetigris\" title=\"OneTigris\"><strong>OneTigris</strong></a> for solid shelters. You can hang out in a <a href=\"/collections/ticket-to-the-moon\" title=\"Ticket to the Moon\"><strong>Ticket to the Moon</strong></a> hammock or get cozy with <a href=\"/collections/sea-to-summit\" title=\"Sea To Summit\"><strong>Sea To Summit</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/stanley\" title=\"Stanley\"><strong>Stanley</strong></a> essentials. Lighting is a big deal, so we keep things bright with <a href=\"/collections/black-diamond\" title=\"Black Diamond\"><strong>Black Diamond</strong></a>, and those classic <a href=\"/collections/feuerhand\" title=\"Feuerhand\"><strong>Feuerhand</strong></a> lanterns. For the heavy lifting around the fire, <a href=\"/collections/petromax\" title=\"Petromax\"><strong>Petromax</strong></a>, <a href=\"/collections/fire-maple\" title=\"Fire Maple\"><strong>Fire Maple</strong></a>, and <a href=\"/collections/jetboil\" title=\"Jetboil\"><strong>Jetboil</strong></a> are absolute workhorses.</p><p>We’ve made sure the basics are covered, too. <a href=\"/collections/hydro-flask\" title=\"Hydro Flask\"><strong>Hydro Flask</strong></a> for cold water, <a href=\"/collections/lifestraw\" title=\"LifeStraw\"><strong>LifeStraw</strong></a> for the safe kind, and <a href=\"/collections/scrubba\" title=\"Scrubba\"><strong>Scrubba</strong></a> for when your clothes actually need a wash. If you like working with your hands, grab a knife from <a href=\"/collections/opinel\" title=\"Opinel\"><strong>Opinel</strong></a> or a carving tool from <a href=\"/collections/beavercraft\" title=\"BeaverCraft\"><strong>Beavercraft</strong></a>. A <a href=\"/collections/leatherman\" title=\"Leatherman\"><strong>Leatherman</strong></a> is always a good idea on your belt, and <a href=\"/collections/outdoor-elements\" title=\"Outdoor Elements\"><strong>Outdoor Elements</strong></a> or <a href=\"/collections/eco-lite\" title=\"Eco-Lite\"><strong>Eco-Lite</strong></a> help get the fire going.</p><p>Planning the route is half the fun, and <a href=\"/collections/silva\" title=\"Silva\"><strong>Silva</strong></a> compasses, <a href=\"/collections/slingsby-maps\" title=\"Slingsby Maps\"><strong>Slingsby Maps</strong></a>, and <a href=\"/collections/tracks4africa\" title=\"Tracks4Africa\"><strong>Tracks4Africa</strong></a> guides are the gold standard for that. Don’t forget the small details—<a href=\"/collections/leuchtturm1917\" title=\"Leuchtturm1917\"><strong>Leuchtturm1917</strong></a> for notes, <a href=\"/collections/thermopro\" title=\"ThermoPro\"><strong>ThermoPro</strong></a> for the perfect braai temp, and <a href=\"/collections/nikwax\" title=\"Nikwax\"><strong>Nikwax</strong></a> to keep your kit waterproof. We even have <a href=\"/collections/toaks\" title=\"Toaks\"><strong>Toaks</strong></a> titanium gear for the weight-savers, <a href=\"/collections/tankwa\" title=\"Tankwa\"><strong>Tankwa</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/govino\" title=\"Govino\"><strong>Govino</strong></a> for the sundowners, and a few bits from <a href=\"/collections/papillon\" title=\"Papillon\"><strong>Papillon</strong></a>. Of course, there’s our own <a href=\"/collections/brave-hardy\" title=\"Brave Hardy\"><strong>Brave Hardy</strong></a> merch to round it all off.</p><p>It’s high-quality gear, built for people who actually enjoy being out there. Explore the collection and find whatever you need for your next adventure.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
